---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="ServiceMatch privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <div class="container py-6 md:py-8 max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-h1 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="prose text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] space-y-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p>ServiceMatch is a marketplace connecting householders in Northern Ireland with vetted local tradespeople. Our contact details are available on our website.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">2. What Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect and process the following data:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Name, email address, and phone number when you create an account or contact a tradesperson</li>
        <li>Location data (town/postcode) to match you with local professionals</li>
        <li>Details of service requests submitted through our chatbot</li>
        <li>Profile information if you join as a tradesperson (qualifications, trade categories, availability)</li>
        <li>Usage data and cookies as described below</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <p>We use your data to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Match householders with suitable tradespeople</li>
        <li>Facilitate communication between customers and tradespeople</li>
        <li>Verify tradesperson credentials and maintain trust standards</li>
        <li>Improve our service and user experience</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">4. Legal Basis (UK GDPR)</h2>
      <p>We process your data under the following lawful bases:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Contract:</strong> To provide our matching and communication services</li>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> For marketing communications (you may withdraw consent at any time)</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> To improve our service and prevent fraud</li>
        <li><strong>Legal obligation:</strong> To comply with applicable laws and regulations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">5. Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Matched tradespeople (your name, contact details, and service request details)</li>
        <li>Service providers who help us operate the platform (hosting, analytics)</li>
        <li>Law enforcement when required by law</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services. You may request deletion of your data at any time.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Access your personal data</li>
        <li>Rectify inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
        <li>Restrict processing</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
        <li>Object to processing</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">8. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use essential cookies for site functionality and optional analytics cookies to improve our service. You can manage cookie preferences in your browser settings.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">9. Security</h2>
      <p>We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your data, including encryption and secure data storage.</p>

      <h2 class="text-h3 text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-6">10. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy-related queries or to exercise your rights, please contact us through our website.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>